      "question": "Modify the existing mounting washer by increasing the central bore radius from 10 mm to 12 mm. Preserve the 60 mm outer diameter, 6 mm thickness, and the smaller hole with radius 3 mm centered at (21,0) mm. Preserve materials, pose and the bottom position. Use the supplied model and program, keeping one real, closed, connected solid; do not fake holes with materials. Input dimensions are in millimetres. Export in metres, right-handed coordinates with Z up, bottom at Z=0. The dimensional tolerance is 0.3 mm. Submit solution.py, an editable scene.blend and scene.glb.；按本题允许修改范围检查形态或照明变化，N中已计的尺寸/数量不在此重复计分。",
